  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where special powers awaken in individuals, a 4-year-old child becomes an S-class hunter but has no parents. Assigned a quest to find guardians, she is eventually adopted by the nation’s top hunter. With a new skill that allows her to register caregivers and earn \"filial piety points\" for growth, she sets out to gather the best guardians to grow stronger and thrive."
